  "arrangerNotes": "Right-hand opening theme, bars 1–4 of the first movement, verified against the Mutopia LilyPond score. 2/2 time written in quarter-note beats; the rest that ends bar 4 is left out. Only the opening phrase is used, because the continuation modulates (chromatic F♯ from bar 7). No simplification needed. Range low 5 to 5. C and D arrangements use identical degree sequences (both fit their drums).",
